{"schemaVersion":1,"corpusId":"euclid-elements-heath-1908","status":"raw_machine","contentItem":{"id":"euclid-10-9","kind":"proposition","title":"长度可公度与平方数比例","englishTitle":"The squares on straight lines commensurable in length have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number; and squares which have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number will also have their sides commensurable in length. But the squares on straight lines incommensurable in length have not to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number; and squares which have not to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number will not have their sides commensurable in length either.","book":10,"number":9,"status":"raw_machine","sourceMissing":false,"source":{"urn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.9","url":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.9/","group":"prop_1","sourceNumber":9,"corpusSha256":"ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c","hasSourceFigure":true,"historicalChineseUrl":null}},"revision":{"id":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","contentId":"euclid-10-9","version":1,"status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"2682c37818223a2fa4df3cd47b9e67c5c3d0d0573edab116a8798fa028753007","createdBy":"mathforge-corpus-import","changeSummary":"Imported Heath source and machine-assisted Chinese draft. No mathematical or editorial review is implied.","blockIds":["euclid-10-9.statement","euclid-10-9.construction.1","euclid-10-9.proof.1","euclid-10-9.construction.2","euclid-10-9.proof.2","euclid-10-9.proof.3","euclid-10-9.proof.4","euclid-10-9.proof.5","euclid-10-9.proof.6","euclid-10-9.proof.7","euclid-10-9.proof.8","euclid-10-9.proof.9","euclid-10-9.proof.10","euclid-10-9.proof.11","euclid-10-9.proof.12","euclid-10-9.proof.13","euclid-10-9.proof.14","euclid-10-9.proof.15","euclid-10-9.proof.16","euclid-10-9.proof.17","euclid-10-9.source"]},"blocks":[{"id":"euclid-10-9.statement","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":0,"kind":"statement","title":"命题陈述","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"0874517cc277549c4024cb7aebac20ab7dc735d8b5dd59f5d38a9fc57f407fe9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"The squares on straight lines commensurable in length have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number; and squares which have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number will also have their sides commensurable in length. But the squares on straight lines incommensurable in length have not to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number; and squares which have not to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number will not have their sides commensurable in length either."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"正方形直线长度可公度之间必须达到平方数对平方数;正方形对平方数对平方数对平方数对平方数对平方数对平方数对平方数对正方形对长度可公度对正方形对不可公度对正方形对平方数对平方数对正方形对正方形对平方数对平方数对平方数对正方形对平方数对正方形对平方数对正方形对平方数对平方数对平方数对正方形对正方形对长度可公度对正方形对正方形对正方形对平方数对正方形对平方数对正方形对平方数对平方数对正方形对平方数"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.construction.1","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":1,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ee949ea2dae76509456b777113fcc0f7041315342d821e4590ac6a927d3a4bc0","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For let A, B be commensurable in length; I say that the square on A has to the square on B the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A,B是长度可公度;我说,A的正方形与B的正方形的比例是平方数与平方数的比例是平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.1","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":2,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 1","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"9c4f4bf924eb135c710c6044543b6a2673c2b0e86f46e04e9ca6d6d7e77dd96d","citations":["euclid-10-5"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, since A is commensurable in length with B, therefore A has to B the ratio which a number has to a number. [[X. 5](/principles/euclid-10-5)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因为A是长度可公度,B,A的比例为B,一个数字等于一个数字。 [[X. 5](/principles/euclid-10-5)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.construction.2","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":3,"kind":"construction","title":"作图与构造 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"881b1dd60c6452a6165aabe856d31ab8a2420bbf551c54cf8cb5d46cc4c4be31","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Let it have to it the ratio which C has to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"让它拥有C比D的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.2","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":4,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 2","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"425684213a11d46c8b0a7b6c5c816d611646ddda45b7f65a25e6e3fe4b67c912","citations":["euclid-6-20","euclid-8-11"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Since then, as A is to B, so is C to D, while the ratio of the square on A to the square on B is duplicate of the ratio of A to B, for similar figures are in the duplicate ratio of their corresponding sides; [[VI. 20, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-20)] and the ratio of the square on C to the square on D is duplicate of the ratio of C to D, for between two square numbers there is one mean proportional number, and the square number has to the square number the ratio duplicate of that which the side has to the side; [[VIII. 11](/principles/euclid-8-11)] therefore also, as the square on A is to the square on B, so is the square on C to the square on D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从那时起,A比B等于C比D。A对B对正方形的比与A对B的比相同。类似数字在相应的平方比个方面;C对D对D的比与D对正方形的比是重复的C对D的比。在两个平方数之间 有一个比例中项码平方数比平方数比重是一方对另一方的重复;因此,A比正方形等于B比正方形等于C比正方形等于D；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。 [[VI. 20, Por.](/principles/euclid-6-20)] [[VIII. 11](/principles/euclid-8-11)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.3","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":5,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 3","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"fca71eb7989ac45f6ef0698c2074ae6a98f649eae80bdf8dd76ee274b73405a8","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, as the square on A is to the square on B, so let the square on C be to the square on D; I say that A is commensurable in length with B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,A正方形是B,B是B,C正方形是D正方形,我说A长度可公度B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.4","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":6,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 4","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"44abd02d39d7d2a176445eb6989067625207b23ecb01cb6ed719668e3c8f55d7","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For since, as the square on A is to the square on B, so is the square on C to the square on D, while the ratio of the square on A to the square on B is duplicate of the ratio of A to B, and the ratio of the square on C to the square on D is duplicate of the ratio of C to D, therefore also, as A is to B, so is C to D."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"自那时以来,A对A对正方形对B对正方形的比等于C对A对正方形的比,B对A对正方形对正方形的比是A对B对B的比是A对B的比,C对C对正方形对正方形的比是C对D的比是C对D的比也是A对B的比；A 与 B 之比等于 C 与 D 之比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.5","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":7,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 5","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"5ebb4bb73c1a0d0cfc4eab8ab0eb1387ba05cb1c43b242540bb5598e2d8c5370","citations":["euclid-10-6"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore A has to B the ratio which the number C has to the number D; therefore A is commensurable in length with B. [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,A比C比D;因此,A是长度可公度和B。 [[X. 6](/principles/euclid-10-6)]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.6","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":8,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 6","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ef0eae2bdf489971f4e03f17119065559115cb3b856322b820794917fe88fe33","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Next, let A be incommensurable in length with B; I say that the square on A has not to the square on B the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"其次,A比B长度为不可公度;我说,A比正方形比B比平方数比平方数比平方数比平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.7","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":9,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 7","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"76085708f515126ace548062ca3bfda4704cb0e8c45156a302947905a56fd5d2","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if the square on A has to the square on B the ratio which a square number has to a square number, A will be commensurable with B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果A的正方形和B的正方形,平方数和平方数的比为平方数,A为可公度和B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.8","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":10,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 8","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d410889a4deb051f612d06de798310bce7d9ef1c4af2a260889c4c5d1cecc8b9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it is not; therefore the square on A has not to the square on B the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但情况并非如此;因此,A比正方形与B比平方数比平方数比平方数比平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.9","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":11,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 9","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8e2cc8541203733a6bcf11ee7b1d8ba560dc2730336d8863147892093f065509","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Again, let the square on A not have to the square on B the ratio which a square number has to a square number; I say that A is incommensurable in length with B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"A的正方形比B的比例为平方数比正方形;我再说一遍,A比不可公度等于B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.10","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":12,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 10","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"719d8c008a09c0e6fc60b62dedfcb5aa3bf956f09fd9267b1f21b3cd76336020","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if A is commensurable with B, the square on A will have to the square on B the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果A是可公度和B,A的正方形将达到B的正方形,平方数的比例将达到平方数和平方数。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.11","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":13,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 11","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"ad1c40c69a11547e9c261f281b6cd4e80f2d25e47f8825978d026a62c6f1b834","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"But it has not; therefore A is not commensurable in length with B."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"但并没有,因此A不是长度可公度和B。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.12","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":14,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 12","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"6d0def46992eb0b105b82d6bce6477450c524a884c436026a0e1ed896becf6c9","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore etc."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"由此命题得证。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.13","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":15,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 13","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"51e3d36eb99fb06e3a7b72080193c47c89c79ac89dead2548af5918c99367d98","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Porism. And it is manifest from what has been proved that straight lines commensurable in length are always commensurable in square also, but those commensurable in square are not always commensurable in length also."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"普瑞斯丁,从长度可公度线长度可公度线正方形可公度线, 可以看出正方形可公度线长度可公度线长度可公度线。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.14","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":16,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 14","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"c38552b46e52bcb2bac64f23b5d9d5d146b95731619798bc948d3d09411a07bc","citations":["euclid-8-26"],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"[Lemma. It has been proved in the arithmetical books that similar plane numbers have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number, [[VIII. 26](/principles/euclid-8-26)] and that, if two numbers have to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number, they are similar plane numbers. [Converse of [VIII. 26](/principles/euclid-8-26)]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"引理：算术各卷已经证明，相似平面数之比等于一个平方数与另一个平方数之比；反过来，如果两个整数之比等于一个平方数与另一个平方数之比，那么这两个整数是相似平面数。 [[VIII. 26](/principles/euclid-8-26)] [VIII. 26](/principles/euclid-8-26)"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.15","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":17,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 15","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"75cd37403175612207f4ff823d4bcec1e63084726384e3088422db0f8c2b94cd","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"And it is manifest from these propositions that numbers which are not similar plane numbers, that is, those which have not their sides proportional, have not to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"从这些假设中可以看出,不是相似平面数,即没有成比例的数值,彼此之间没有平方数与平方数的比。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.16","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":18,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 16","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"8f39194ceea91faa8c50450d900155123e18f2866008d91797067ea4065719cb","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"For, if they have, they will be similar plane numbers: which is contrary to the hypothesis."},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"如果它们有,它们就等于相似平面数,这与假设不符。"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.proof.17","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":19,"kind":"proof_step","title":"证明 17","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"188c2d1a24f511f204b16e20acb630dea6e9da723d2b30674f2c98048cf41d1a","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"heath-en","role":"source","language":"en","status":"source_transcription","text":"Therefore numbers which are not similar plane numbers have not to one another the ratio which a square number has to a square number.]"},{"id":"machine-zh","role":"machine_translation","language":"zh-CN","status":"raw_machine","text":"因此,不是相似平面数的号码之间没有平方数与平方数之间的比。 ]"}]},{"id":"euclid-10-9.source","contentId":"euclid-10-9","revisionId":"euclid-10-9@raw-2682c37818223a2f","order":20,"kind":"source","title":"来源、译者与开放许可","status":"raw_machine","contentHash":"d4b83b4ed30cdc074147afa473052166a2ed07a2fd37d75e8299dd7f158caa8c","citations":[],"surfaces":[{"id":"provenance","role":"provenance_note","language":"en","status":"generated_metadata","text":"Perseus / Heath source: https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.9/\nCorpus URN: urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.9\nCorpus SHA-256: ba12e2e47aec41f853ff32929a2d0467926f93280f1bf8870bda5016c29d143c\nLicense: CC BY-SA 4.0 (https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/)"}]}],"outgoingEdges":[{"id":"edge:euclid-10-9:euclid-10-5:explicit","sourceContentId":"euclid-10-9","sourceBlockIds":["euclid-10-9.proof.1"],"targetContentId":"euclid-10-5","type":"depends_on","provenance":{"kind":"explicit_source_reference","basis":"perseus_tei_ref","sourceUrn":"urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.tlg001.perseus-eng2:10.prop_1.9","sourceUrl":"https://scaife.perseus.org/reader/urn:cts:greekLit:tlg1799.t